### Example

```
Enter a number: 9
The square root of 9 is 3
```

### Implementation

```c
#include <stdio.h>
#include <math.h>

int main(int argc, char *argv[]) {
    double number;

    // prompt for the number
    printf("Enter a number: ");
    scanf("%lf", &number);

    // print the square root of the number
    printf("The square root of %lf is %lf\n", number, sqrt(number));

    return 0;
}
```

