## Freeing Memory

To free the memory, use the `free` function:

```c
#include <stdio.h>
#include <stdlib.h>

int main(int argc, char *argv[]) {
    // get buffer size from argv
    int buffer_size = atoi(argv[1]);
    // allocate buffer
