## 3.2.3. 指针运算

指针运算是指在内存中移动指针的过程。

### 3.2.3.1. 指针的算术运算

指针的算术运算包括加法运算和减法运算。

```c
#include <stdio.h>
#include <stdlib.h>

int main(int argc, char *argv[]) {
    // get buffer size from argv
    int buffer_size = atoi(argv[1]);
    // allocate buffer
    char *buffer = (char *)malloc(buffer_size);
    // move pointer
    buffer += 10;
    // print buffer
    printf("%s\n", buffer);
}
```

### 3.2.3.2. 指针的比较运算

指针的比较运算包括等于运算、不等于运算、大于运算和小于运算。

```c
#include <stdio.h>
#include <stdlib.h>

int main(int argc, char *argv[]) {
    // get buffer size from argv
    int buffer_size = atoi(argv[1]);
    // allocate buffer
    char *buffer = (char *)malloc(buffer_size);
    // move pointer
    buffer += 10;
    // compare pointers
    if (buffer == buffer + 10) {
        printf("Equal\n");
    } else {
        printf("Not equal\n");
    }
}
```

### 3.2.3.3. 指针的位运算

指针的位运算包括按位与运算、按位或运算和按位异或运算。

```c
#include <stdio.h>
#include <stdlib.h>

int main(int argc, char *argv[]) {
    // get buffer size from argv
    int buffer_size = atoi(argv[1]);
    // allocate buffer
    char *buffer = (char *)malloc(buffer_size);
    // move pointer
    buffer += 10;
    // bitwise and
    printf("%d\n", buffer & 0x0F);
    // bitwise or
    printf("%d\n", buffer | 0x0F);
    // bitwise xor
    printf("%d\n", buffer ^ 0x0F);
}
```

